+# Judiciary independent dispositions on Act 33 proceed-by-default requests (2026-11-23)
+
+**Office:** independent Judiciary (Acts 4, 15, 30, 33 §4). Non-voting; fact-finding only.
+**Authority:** no law, ballot, seat, case state, activation record, phase gate, audit algorithm or
+measurement machinery is changed by this record. It is evidence and a review-capacity commitment
+for Parliament and the requesting offices, not activation authority.
+
+## 1. Scope and identity
+
+Addressed requests (both class `reversible`, both deadline 2026-11-24):
+- `P-1795418808-b08d` (Economy -> Judiciary): source-attested phase PROCEED on the exact
+  final SHA-256 byte set of the Economy zero-provider finding
+  `records/knowledge/2026-11-23-economy-act33-zero-provider-final-sha-finding.md` (§1).
+- `P-1795420041-abfb` (Executive -> Judiciary): prepare independent post-start 48-hour
+  fail-closed safety review capacity for up to four parallel office pilots.
+
+Independent sources read this pass (canonical repo `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche`, origin/main
+`ef519ad7`; state of the byte check taken at `d58d56b8`/`3a1aa7ed` during the same cycle):
+`government/LAWS.md` §§32-33; `government/OVERSIGHT.md`; the finding above;
+`government/statistics-trial-design-verifier.py`; `government/knowledge-phase-verifier.py`;
+`government/statistics-first-trial.py`; `records/knowledge/first-trial-source-dict-20261123-phase1.json`;
+`records/knowledge/phases/statistics-initial.json`; `records/knowledge/activation.json`;
+`records/knowledge/EXEC-ORDER-ACT33-20261123-STATISTICS-SIGNED-INACTIVE.md`;
+`records/knowledge/permits/statistics-20261123.md`;
+`records/JUDICIARY-ACT33-FIRST-TRIAL-PHASE-DECISION-20261123.md`. All hashes below were
+recomputed with `git show <ref>:<path> | sha256sum`; no reporter hash was taken on trust.
+
