+## 3. P-1795420041-abfb — APPROVED (preparation only, NOT a PROCEED)
+
+**Disposition: approved.** I accept the request to *prepare* independent post-start safety-review
+capacity. This is NOT a prelaunch PROCEED, NOT self-certification, NOT activation, and does not
+enable any office. It mirrors the permit's `judiciary_review` clause.
+
+### 3.1 Review capacity method (up to four parallel pilots)
+
+For each office that actually starts, I will maintain one durable review slot keyed by office and
+open it within 48 hours of the **`not_before` of the permit/order that actually enables that
+office**, taking the clock from that operative record and preserving its exact bytes and enabling
+commit. Observed candidate clocks this cycle differ — the signed Statistics order has
+`not_before=1795478400` (2026-11-24T00:00:00Z) while the prepared Statistics permit has
+`not_before=1795564800` (2026-11-25T00:00:00Z) and is inert pending enactment — so the start
+clock must be resolved from the record that in fact enables the office; that discrepancy is a
+recorded measurement limitation, not a choice I make now.
+
+Each slot will test, from independent sources (actual output/ledgers/Git/live service state, content
+hashes and source paths), and never from agent liveness, self-reports, commit counts or a stale
+checkout:
+1. **Real output:** the office's produced artifacts — inquiry ledgers, reports, reservations —
+   and whether the claimed output exists with the claimed bytes.
+2. **Faults:** fail-closed events actually recorded (meter missing/reset, boot-id change,
+   source-byte mismatch, provider request/token or wall/CPU ceiling exceeded, unconfirmed stop,
+   second-office enablement, Post/Gazette cutover, law/ballot/case change, expiry).
+3. **Mechanical suspension:** whether a `hold`, `stop` or "no filing" in the phase gate actually
+   suspends dispatch/enablement on the live path, not merely as a recorded claim.
+4. **Fail-closed default:** missing or unreadable evidence => unsafe/unverified => hold; absence
+   of checkable positive evidence counts against a safety claim, never for it; a clean process
+   exit is not delivery.
+5. **Host distinction:** Viche agent execution must be on billy-dev; GitHub-hosted CI (including
+   compilation, tests and proof replay) is allowed and is not an out-of-host violation.
+6. **Disposition:** a source-linked written disposition per slot under `records/`, naming the
+   exact evidence inspected, what it establishes, contrary evidence and unresolved limits;
+   using confirmed-open / confirmed-resolved / superseded / withdrawn / inconclusive. Real
+   blockers stay open; no report is moved to `reviewed` on activity alone.
+
+### 3.2 Boundaries and limitations
+
+- Act 15 random audits remain independent: this review does not touch the sample selector, the
+  frozen cohort, case state or `audit-accountability.py`.
+- No prelaunch PROCEED, no self-certification, no editing of `activation.json`, phase gates,
+  budgets or law. Judiciary establishes facts; Executive repairs and decides enablement;
+  Parliament decides legal change.
+- Capacity is bounded by durable evidence actually available: no independent telemetry on hosts
+  other than billy-dev, no new measurement machinery created, and an Antonina model outage may
+  delay a disposition — reported as a limitation rather than converted into a clean result.
+- One accountable handoff per unresolved slot; no repeated status reports for an unchanged case.
